Z||000000||85 gt fiero||10-01-2001||08:17 AM||||I was wondering if anyone has ever saw a pair of black tailight covers for an 85 gt, do they even make them or is there a way you can paint the covers transparent black(dont even no if they make that) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">.  Any help would be appreciated.    Randy||||reg||1
Z||000001||fiero_hunter85||10-01-2001||08:22 AM||||i dont know about the covers but what you can do is remove the tail lights and pry each tail light apart and use window tint on the inside of the clear lens.<BR>i did that to a 84 se i used to have and it worked good  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||7
