Z||000003||fiero_hunter85||10-01-2001||08:57 AM||||sorry. i only had the SE for about 2 months and i never got around to taking pictures of it. but i can tell you they look just like stock ones only you can have them as dark as you want just by getting whatever shade tint you want.<P>now i have to go to bed before i pass out   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><p>[This message has been edited by fiero_hunter85 (edited 10-01-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||ChopTop||10-01-2001||08:58 AM||||I remember you used to be able to buy tinted paint spray cans.  Not sure they still sell the stuff though, it was available at most automotive chain stores.  Also, I'm sure you're aware of the safety issues that tinted taillamps pose.  Since you have a 85 you may want to install the 3rd brake light that was installed in the Fiero starting in 1986 for additional security.||||reg||1
