Z||000010||FieroLisa||10-01-2001||09:06 PM||||why, yes I do have tinted taillights on my GT. I have some pretty good pics of them on my website, but you'll just have to search for them.... umm I should have some good taillight pics at <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/williamsburg.html" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/fierolisa/williamsburg.html</A>  <BR>Anywho, yah take the taillights apart and spray tint the inside of the lenses. Its easy and looks d@mn sweet.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/fierolisa.gif">     <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A>*<A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>NC Tarheels Fieros Site</A><P>AIM: FieroLisa||||reg||1
